  "Overview": "Soul is the adaption of the critically acclaimed XBox Indie Game :5/5 - wedonetwork.co.uk - \"Turn the lights out, close the curtains and let the horror begin.\"7.5/10 - xboxhornet.wordpress.com - \"A solid entry that epitomizes the “Games As Art” philosophy.\"7/10 - gamerlimit.com - \"What really shines in Soul is the artwork and the simplicity of the presentation.\"In Soul your goal is to bring the soul of a dead man to heaven throughout mazes that are going to test your dexterity and composure.Features:High resolution hand drawn levelsImmersive and scary environmentsIntuitive gameplay using the accelerometerFrightening sound effect3 difficulty modes",
